{
    "title": "Tattoo Design & Tattoo Maker",
    "description": "Tattoo Design & Tattoo Maker is the perfect app for anyone who loves tattoo art or is thinking about getting \r\none tattoo. With this application, you can design your own tattoo or refer to available designs. application\r\nalso offers features for you to see how the tattoo looks on your body before deciding to actually get the tattoo.\r\nFrom drawing, editing to adding text, the app gives you the tools you need to create unique tattoos.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf08 Main features:\r\n\r\n\u2714\ufe0fDesign custom tattoos: Use creative tools to draw and design your own unique tattoos. You can adjust\r\nflip and rotate the tattoo to ensure it fits the intended location on your body.\r\n\u2714\ufe0fThe app's built-in drawing tools: you can also choose different types of brushes, adjust size,\r\nand choose from a diverse color palette to make your designs more unique and impressive.\r\n\u2714\ufe0fAdd text to your design: You can add text to your design, choose from many different fonts, change colors\r\nand size, even rotate or flip text to fit your design.\r\n\u2714\ufe0fExtensive tattoo library: Choose from many tattoo designs available in the app. From beautiful small tattoos\r\nto larger and more intricate designs, you'll find many options to suit your style.\r\n\u2714\ufe0fCreate a tattoo on your own body: Take a photo or upload a photo of your body to the app and design a tattoo on it. \r\nYou can rotate or scale photos after capture for a realistic look.\r\n\u2714\ufe0fShare with friends: Once you complete your design, you can share your work with your friends via social networks.\r\nGet feedback from people before you decide to get a tattoo.\r\n\u2714\ufe0fFriendly interface: The application's interface is designed to be simple and easy to use, making it easy for users to use.\r\n\u2714\ufe0fSupports many languages: Tattoo Design & Tattoo Maker supports many languages, helping you use\r\napplication in the most convenient way.\r\n\r\nThe app is a great companion for those who want to express themselves through tattoo art. Whether you are one\r\nProfessional or beginner tattoo artist, this app will help you turn your ideas into reality.\r\n\ud83c\udf80 Download today and start your creative journey!\ud83c\udf80",
    "descriptionHTML": "Tattoo Design &amp; Tattoo Maker is the perfect app for anyone who loves tattoo art or is thinking about getting <br>one tattoo. With this application, you can design your own tattoo or refer to available designs. application<br>also offers features for you to see how the tattoo looks on your body before deciding to actually get the tattoo.<br>From drawing, editing to adding text, the app gives you the tools you need to create unique tattoos.<br><br>\ud83c\udf08 Main features:<br><br>\u2714\ufe0fDesign custom tattoos: Use creative tools to draw and design your own unique tattoos. You can adjust<br>flip and rotate the tattoo to ensure it fits the intended location on your body.<br>\u2714\ufe0fThe app&#39;s built-in drawing tools: you can also choose different types of brushes, adjust size,<br>and choose from a diverse color palette to make your designs more unique and impressive.<br>\u2714\ufe0fAdd text to your design: You can add text to your design, choose from many different fonts, change colors<br>and size, even rotate or flip text to fit your design.<br>\u2714\ufe0fExtensive tattoo library: Choose from many tattoo designs available in the app. From beautiful small tattoos<br>to larger and more intricate designs, you&#39;ll find many options to suit your style.<br>\u2714\ufe0fCreate a tattoo on your own body: Take a photo or upload a photo of your body to the app and design a tattoo on it. <br>You can rotate or scale photos after capture for a realistic look.<br>\u2714\ufe0fShare with friends: Once you complete your design, you can share your work with your friends via social networks.<br>Get feedback from people before you decide to get a tattoo.<br>\u2714\ufe0fFriendly interface: The application&#39;s interface is designed to be simple and easy to use, making it easy for users to use.<br>\u2714\ufe0fSupports many languages: Tattoo Design &amp; Tattoo Maker supports many languages, helping you use<br>application in the most convenient way.<br><br>The app is a great companion for those who want to express themselves through tattoo art. Whether you are one<br>Professional or beginner tattoo artist, this app will help you turn your ideas into reality.<br>\ud83c\udf80 Download today and start your creative journey!\ud83c\udf80",
